13425910", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/787972803_1464307316759243_5776397756836108014_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FHAFQfBVpZUQ7kNvwGDIzjg&_nc_oc=AdpGkR35tqA6H2XOiZIi5SCUJAwvq9v8zh81A-lcWi4h_rC5amT3YhheBLDD-Bf_yxo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS68he-GzpUoHdV8ZFtLwWTDwFsOntuYgWTFVy3g7cBpw&oe=6B0DB5EF"}, "display_name": "Forgotten Possessions", "keywords": ["horror", "stealth", "survival", "scary", "adventure"], "long_description": "**They say some things are better left forgotten. In this cabin, they are hunting you.**\n\nForgotten Possessions is a raw, physics-based VR horror experience crafted by a solo developer. No hand-holding. No safety net. Just you, your flashlight, and the crushing weight of the silence.\n\n{1521524765935490}\n\n# Why you will fear the dark\n\n- Ever-Changing Nightmare: Item locations and scares are randomized. Every run is a fresh descent into madness \u2014 you never know where the next item hides or where she will strike.\n\n- **The Guardian:** A relentless AI that watches, listens and hunts. She reacts to every footstep and tracks your last known position. Silence is your only weapon.\n\n- **Unravel the Truth:** Explore the cabin to find hidden collectibles and piece together a dark, forgotten history. Each run reveals more of the story.\n\n- **Scoring Mode:** Chase your high score in a frantic collecting run that pushes your stealth and survival to the limit.\n\n- **Hard Story Mode:** Know every trick and every hiding spot? Face the unforgiving hard mode and prove you can survive.", "short_description": "Find and collect items that tell a dark story in an abandoned log cabin, but watch out for what lurks behind you. You sneak through dark rooms against a relentless, adaptive creature. Forget combat\u2014patience and stealth are your only mission. Experience a dynamic world with randomized item locations and a reactive environment. Evade the guardian as she reacts to noise and hunts you. Piece by piece, reveal the chilling past and examine items in your personal safe room."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://glock-software.de/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Glock Software", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://forgotten-possessions.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "40022606927385204"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828806_757552057010990_8479664881330519934_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vWfcYKMKyn0Q7kNvwHQTOH6&_nc_oc=AdrZMCSXet2F-ki_Zs_8DMBeq_xcT84SuaswONq9zk6b9gF02YeDrjvLq_6ei1m8tGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS7kc6XRczrlsrimhiMPjjTbzjfX6JPxsM43ERe8oz1Vg&oe=6B0D99B2"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Forgotten Possessions", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Adventure", "id": "2691890164460465"}, {"topic_name": "Narrative", "id": "1008279844328894"}, {"topic_name